    "gp-global-section-517826748927181606": {
      "gg1bq_V3nlA_text_html": "<p><a href=\"https://wellnessnest.co/\">Wellness Nest</a> / Shilajit resin</p>",
      "gg6lsh3ovYa_text_html": "The Rarest Shilajit on Earth - 24K Gold-Infused Himalayan Shilajit - Ancient Ayurvedic Secret",
      "ggY0FoeDPmx_text_html": "<p>4.9/5*</p>",
      "gg7g92mo1na_text_html": "<p>1800+ reviews</p>",
      "ggb2Fyq4NWk_text_html": "<p>I first saw Shilajit via social media, and i’m sure what any curious mind would do, is start either googling or youtubing the benefits before buying. I’m not the one to buy the cheapest stuff, if it’s legit and will almost be as close to a sure thing, then well i will give it a chance. A few months of taking it for males, you should notice your sex drive is improved. At least for me.</p>",
      "ggwe8QZ-zeP_text_html": "H. Castillo, The Father of 3, The Husband of 1 Wife, and the Energizer Bunny of the Bedroom",
      "ggHDdSd7uEY_text_html": "The Rarest Shilajit on Earth - 24K Gold-Infused Himalayan Shilajit - Ancient Ayurvedic Secret",
      "ggH507LJwzk_text_html": "<p>4.9/5*</p>",
      "gg98NsFXfeD_text_html": "<p>1800+ reviews</p>",
      "ggjVzbaqwmx_childItem_0_html": "<p>How to Use</p>",
      "ggjVzbaqwmx_childItem_1_html": "<p>Ingredient</p>",
      "ggjVzbaqwmx_childItem_2_html": "<p>Benefits</p>",
      "ggNb961-FGg_text_html": "<p>Take a pea-sized portion using the golden spoon.</p>",
      "ggWbWdyvbqT_text_html": "<p>Take a pea-sized portion using the golden spoon.</p>",
      "ggHOuJRmdUk_text_html": "<p>Repeat in the evening.</p>",
      "ggRDChB-nJu_text_html": "<p>Enjoy increased energy and mental focus.</p>",
      "gg9F0CoKyuo_text_html": "<p>Our Shilajit is sourced from the pristine Himalayan mountains at altitudes exceeding 17,000 feet, ensuring unparalleled purity and potency. It's packed with:</p>",
      "gg3koc2xx5M_text_html": "<p><strong>Trace Gold:</strong> Promotes a radiant complexion and overall well-being.</p>",
      "ggX4eWo-Ach_text_html": "<p><strong>86+ Trace Minerals:</strong> Essential for numerous bodily functions.</p>",
      "gg8rveMeERN_text_html": "<p><strong>Eurofins Certificate: </strong>Each batch of our Shilajit is rigorously tested by Eurofins to guarantee the highest quality in the industry. Experience the difference that purity makes with our Pure Himalayan Shilajit.</p>",
      "ggJM7MWySI4_text_html": "<p>Experience a surge of natural vitality that fuels your workouts and daily activities.</p>",
      "ggvp4uAuhXC_text_html": "<p>Quiet mental chatter and embrace a state of clarity and peace.</p>",
