      "ggkOCIdnmYD_text_html": "<p>Adam L.</p>",
      "gg0Y4hWWQ4Y_text_html": "<p>\"<span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(15,17,17);font-size:14px;\">I've been taking this supplement for about 1.5 months now. I was not exercising regularly when I started. Apart from a slight positive mood improvement, there wasn't much that happened the first two weeks.\"</span></p>"
