    "gp-global-section-552009928336737130": {
      "gg7r70d23EH_text_html": "Unlock Your Potential: Supercharge Muscle Growth &amp; Performance with Cutting-Edge Science",
      "ggljSjqW5im_text_html": "<p>Premium Shilajit Alpha King: The Science Behind the Strength</p>",
      "ggfq_SujGfC_text_html": "Himalayan Shilajit",
      "ggKPoCa7TtY_text_html": "394+ Studies | 250 mg in Premium Shilajit Alpha King",
      "ggxASdjNb-f_text_html": "<p>Tap into the Ancient Powerhouse: This extract, sourced from the pristine Himalayan mountains, is rich in fulvic acid, a potent antioxidant. Shilajit may help boost energy levels, improve mitochondrial function (the powerhouses of your cells), and support overall vitality.*</p>",
