      "ggS98MyhEFP_text_html": "<p>ACTIVATION</p>",
      "ggi6Wv8Ogck_text_html": "<p>The body’s signal to produce testosterone is Luteinizing Hormone. Without enough LH, your testosterone stays locked away, untapped and unused.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Shilajit stimulates LH secretion and triggers new testosterone production</p>",
      "ggpkZvHOnuY_text_html": "<p>INTERFERENCE SHUTDOWN</p>",
      "ggnTM3Ny9IW_text_html": "<p>Cortisol and testosterone are inversely correlated - when one goes up, the other goes down. Chronic stress floods your system with cortisol, interfering with testosterone production. </p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>By preventing cortisol from spiking, shilajit shields your testosterone and allows it to do its job without disturbance.</p>",
      "ggJBo2gXv56_text_html": "<p>HORMONAL FUEL</p>",
      "gg5GtvaaAip_text_html": "<p>The body doesn’t just “make” testosterone - it has to power the process. Testosterone production requres high levels cellular fuel.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;Highly concentrated fulvic acid in shilajit boosts energy production in the cells that make testosterone.</p>",
      "ggTyICV0rnX_text_html": "<p>84+ Minerals</p>",
      "ggdWnviQTdX_text_html": "<p>78% FULVIC ACID</p>",
      "ggfoyCNjRYP_text_html": "<p>NATA-APPROVED</p>",
      "gg_1Bq8g9s1_text_html": "<p>GPM CERTIFIED</p>",
      "ggfchpImdmD_text_html": "<p>NON-GMO +&nbsp;</p><p>VEGAN FRIENDLY</p>",
      "ggfJHeVaZkV_text_html": "<p>84+ Minerals</p>",
